  entries:
  - textKey: dialogue.rescue_contact.service.choice.accept
    korean: 신호를 공유받는다.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: RescueContact service accept choice
    notes: Executes the registered RescueContact action when available
    maxLengthHint: 24
  - textKey: dialogue.rescue_contact.service.choice.decline
    korean: 지금은 필요 없다.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: RescueContact service decline choice
    notes: Closes without a gameplay action
    maxLengthHint: 24
  - textKey: dialogue.rescue_contact.service.line_01
    korean: 구조 신호를 따라온 건가? 살았다는 게 아직 실감이 안 나는군.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: RescueContact service opening line
    notes: Approved Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.rescue_contact.service.line_02
    korean: 숨어 있는 동안 이 해역의 코어 추적 신호를 모아뒀어. 받아가면 목표 위치를 더 빨리 좁힐 수 있을 거야.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: RescueContact service offer line
    notes: Approved Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 112
  - textKey: dialogue.rescue_contact.service.unavailable
    korean: 이미 공유받았거나 현재는 신호를 받을 수 없다.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: RescueContact unavailable response
    notes: Used instead of a disabled-choice reason in Phase 2B
    maxLengthHint: 56
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_01
    korean: 귀환 신호에서 비정상 파형이 검출됐다. 회수한 물체와 기체 기록을 격리 분석 중이다.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement unknown-core analysis line 1
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 96
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_02
    korean: 네 기체에 붙은 건 단순한 오염이 아니야. 붕괴 전 물류망에 접속하던 키 구조와 닮았어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement unknown-core analysis line 2
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 104
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_03
    korean: 문제는 손상됐다는 거야. 그대로 두면 어디에 연결되는지조차 알 수 없어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement unknown-core analysis line 3
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 88
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_04
    korean: 정착지 단말에서 임시 경로 세 개를 복원했어. 각 해역의 관리 장치에 안정화 부품이 남아 있을 가능성이 높아.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement quest route line 4
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 120
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_05
    korean: 구획 안정기, 물질 압축로, 위상 항법 렌즈. 세 부품을 확보하면 접속키를 완성할 수 있어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement quest parts line 5
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 104
  - textKey: dialogue.story.first_settlement_unknown_core.line_06
    korean: 탐사 경로를 등록할게. 준비가 끝나면 출발해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: First Settlement quest start line 6
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.story.main_damaged_access_key.active_0
    korean: 경로는 세 곳 모두 살아 있어. 가까운 신호부터 확인해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Damaged access-key repeat dialogue at zero parts
    notes: Read-only authoritative quest state
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.story.main_damaged_access_key.active_1
    korean: 첫 부품은 안정적이야. 두 개 남았어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Damaged access-key repeat dialogue at one part
    notes: Read-only authoritative quest state
    maxLengthHint: 48
  - textKey: dialogue.story.main_damaged_access_key.active_2
    korean: 두 신호가 맞물렸어. 마지막 부품만 있으면 조립할 수 있어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Damaged access-key repeat dialogue at two parts
    notes: Read-only authoritative quest state
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.story.main_damaged_access_key.completed
    korean: 접속키가 안정화됐어. 이제 중앙 네트워크로 이어진 경로를 추적할 수 있어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Damaged access-key repeat dialogue after completion
    notes: Read-only RouteCore state
    maxLengthHint: 88
  - textKey: dialogue.story.main_damaged_access_key.ready_to_restore
    korean: 세 부품 확인 완료. 정착지 복구에서 접속키를 복원할 수 있어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Damaged access-key repeat dialogue when all parts are ready
    notes: Read-only authoritative quest state
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.fake_operator_takeover.line_01
    korean: 경로를 확인했어. 레이더의 미확인 신호를 따라가.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial corrupted Operator takeover
    notes: FakeOperator uses the Operator display name while retaining a stable hidden actor identity
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.operator_ancient_signal.line_01
    korean: 고가치 잔해 신호야. 방어 기체가 있을 수 있으니 조심해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial ancient-signal guidance
    notes: Shown only after the ancient wreck signal is detected
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.operator_opening.line_01
    korean: 들리면 추진기를 움직여 봐. 여기서는 직접 길을 찾아야 해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial movement guidance
    notes: Shown when the movement objective becomes active
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.operator_radar.line_01
    korean: '[var=VS_RadarToggleBinding]로 레이더를 켠 뒤, [var=VS_RadarScanBinding]로 스캔해.'
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial Radar guidance
    notes: Input binding variables are populated immediately before conversation start
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.operator_supply_container.line_01
    korean: 보급 컨테이너를 찾았어. 접근해서 파괴하고 자원을 회수해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial supply-container guidance
    notes: Starts after the owner-scoped camera finishes focusing the discovered target
    maxLengthHint: 72
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_01
    korean: …들려?
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial rescue line 1 after communication recovery
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 16
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_02
    korean: 지금까지 통신이 완전히 끊겨 있었어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial rescue line 2 after communication recovery
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 48
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.rescue_after_curse.line_03
    korean: 기체 표면에 정체불명의 접속 패턴이 번지고 있어. 회수 신호를 열었어. 당장 돌아와.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial rescue line 3 requesting existing return flow
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 96
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.signal_relay_analysis.line_01
    korean: 신호 장치 분석 완료. 미확인 좌표를 복원하고 있어.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial signal-relay analysis line 1
    notes: Real Operator confirms authoritative relay analysis
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.signal_relay_analysis.line_02
    korean: 잠깐, 통신 채널에 비정상 간섭이—
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial signal-relay analysis line 2
    notes: Real Operator transmission cuts off before the fake takeover
    maxLengthHint: 56
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.unknown_access_key.line_01
    korean: 이 신호… 붕괴 전 물류망 규격과 비슷해.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial unknown access-key contact line 1
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 56
  - textKey: dialogue.tutorial.unknown_access_key.line_02
    korean: 잠깐, 접속 패턴이 기체 쪽으로—
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Tutorial unknown access-key contact line 2
    notes: Approved Phase 2C Korean source
    maxLengthHint: 48
  - textKey: quest.main_damaged_access_key.notification.restored
    korean: 손상된 접속키 복구 완료.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Main quest restoration completion notification
    notes: Published once by Settlement Recovery authority
    maxLengthHint: 40
  - textKey: quest.main_damaged_access_key.notification.started
    korean: 메인 퀘스트 시작 — 손상된 접속키
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Main quest start notification
    notes: Published by Settlement authority after persistent start
    maxLengthHint: 48
  - textKey: quest.main_damaged_access_key.objective.parts
