    notes: Read-only authoritative quest state
    maxLengthHint: 24
  - textKey: quest.main_damaged_access_key.restoration.description
    korean: 세 안정화 부품을 결합해 손상된 접속키를 복원합니다.
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
    traditionalChinese:
    context: Settlement Recovery description
    notes: Explicit player-confirmed quest completion
    maxLengthHint: 64
  - textKey: quest.main_damaged_access_key.restoration.ready
    korean: 복구 준비 완료
    english:
    japanese:
    simplifiedChinese:
